sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant CFF as CloudFront Function (Viewer Req)
    participant CF as CloudFront Cache
    participant LE as Lambda@Edge (Origin Req)
    participant O as Origin (S3/ALB)
    
    U->>CFF: HTTP Request
    CFF->>CFF: Normalize URL/Headers
    CFF->>CF: Forward Request
    CF->>CF: Check Cache
    alt Cache Miss
        CF->>LE: Trigger Origin Request
        LE->>O: Forward Request
        O->>CF: Response
        CF->>CF: Cache Response
    end
    CF->>U: HTTP Response
